---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /now/
title: Now
description: What I'm building, training for and listening to at the moment.
---
<div class="narrow">
  <header class="page-head">
    <span class="label">now · updated {{ now.updated | date("long") }}</span>
    <h1>now</h1>
    <p class="lede">What I'm doing at the moment. This page replaces the blog I never wrote.</p>
  </header>
  <ul class="facts">
    {%- if now.building %}<li class="ch-code"><span class="chip">building</span><span>{{ now.building }}</span></li>{% endif %}
    {%- if now.training %}<li class="ch-distance"><span class="chip">training for</span><span>{{ now.training }}</span></li>{% endif %}
    {%- if now.playing %}<li class="ch-sound"><span class="chip">practising</span><span>{{ now.playing }}</span></li>{% endif %}
    {%- if now.listening %}<li class="ch-sound"><span class="chip">on repeat</span><span>{{ now.listening }}</span></li>{% endif %}
  </ul>
  <div class="prose section">
    {{ now.body | md | safe }}
  </div>
</div>
